    merged_team_mode_live_test.go:137: {"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"ae39eaf82131e371a","tool_use_id":"toolu_01QX6frjLaupBCUEfbLzuTom","description":"Reading /tmp/spacedock-dispatch/8c4cec5c-19f0-45f5-865d-cd28893058ee-spacedock-ensign-make-it-work-implementation.md","subagent_type":"spacedock:ensign","usage":{"total_tokens":14431,"tool_uses":3,"duration_ms":10823},"last_tool_name":"Read","uuid":"0a736cea-5f33-41a5-8cee-a2ef933aaac8","session_id":"8c4cec5c-19f0-45f5-865d-cd28893058ee"}
    merged_team_mode_live_test.go:137: {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MkJ3gQjNvkAP1vJ1B3RPLv","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t## First action\n2\t\n3\tBefore anything else, invoke your operating contract:\n4\t\n5\t    Skill(skill=\"spacedock:ensign\")\n6\t\n7\tThis loads the shared ensign discipline (stage-report format, BashOutput polling, worktree ownership, completion signal protocol). The call is safe to call more than once; if the agent-definition preload ever starts working, calling it again is a no-op (the skill content is re-loaded but has no behavioral effect). Do not paraphrase; call the tool.\n8\t\n9\tYou are working on: Make It Work\n10\t\n11\tStage: implementation\n12\t\n13\tRead the entity file at /private/var/folders/h1/vnssm1dj6ks4nzzvx8y29yjm0000gn/T/TestLiveMergedTeamModeDispatch3798258893/002/make-it-work.md for the current spec.\n14\t\n15\t### Completion checklist\n16\t\n17\tThe note is recorded in the entity body per the implementation stage output.\n18\t\n19\t### Summary\n20\t{brief description of what was accomplished}\n21\t\n22\t### Fetch commands\n23\t\n24\t    spacedock_launcher() { if [ -n \"${SPACEDOCK_BIN:-}\" ] && [ -x \"${SPACEDOCK_BIN:-}\" ]; then \"$SPACEDOCK_BIN\" \"$@\"; else spacedock \"$@\"; fi; }; spacedock_launcher dispatch show-stage-def --workflow-dir /private/var/folders/h1/vnssm1dj6ks4nzzvx8y29yjm0000gn/T/TestLiveMergedTeamModeDispatch3798258893/002 --stage implementation\n25\t\n26\t\n27\t### Completion Signal\n28\t\n29\tWhen you finish (after all commits and stage report writes are done), your last action MUST be:\n30\t\n31\t    SendMessage(to=\"team-lead\", message=\"Done: Make It Work completed implementation. Report written to /private/var/folders/h1/vnssm1dj6ks4nzzvx8y29yjm0000gn/T/TestLiveMergedTeamModeDispatch3798258893/002/make-it-work.md.\")\n32\t\n33\t**If you are the first officer forwarding this prompt to Agent():** copy the entire block above into `Agent(prompt=...)` character-for-character. Do NOT paraphrase `SendMessage(to=\"team-lead\", ...)` as \"SendMessage with to='team-lead'\" or any other English rewrite — the parenthesis-equals syntax is the literal call the ensign must emit, not a description of one."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01QX6frjLaupBCUEfbLzuTom","session_id":"8c4cec5c-19f0-45f5-865d-cd28893058ee","uuid":"4d633034-9215-4872-a1e4-215b8826aa48","timestamp":"2026-07-02T11:05:38.509Z","subagent_type":"spacedock:ensign","task_description":"Make It Work: implementation"}
